प्र-√ ख्या P. -ख्याति, to see, RV. (Subj. -ख्यत्; inf. -ख्यै॑), ŚBr. (ind.p. -ख्याय);
to announce, proclaim, extol, BhP. (Impv. -ख्याहि) :
Pass. -ख्यायते, to be seen or known;
to be visible or public or acknowledged or celebrated, Mn.; MBh. &c.:
Caus. -ख्यापयति, to make generally known, proclaim, announce, publish, Mālatīm.; Rājat.
